This file introduces configuration of bt_host image.

/*============================================================================*
 *                          bt_host_0_0                                    *
 *============================================================================*/
The flash size of bt_host_0_0 image is 212K. If Application uses bt_host_0_0, 
Application should configure NS_RAM_UPPERSTACK_SIZE as value which is larger than or equal to (3 * 1024) in mem_config.h of Application.

/** @brief data ram size for Bluetooth Host global variables and code */
#define NS_RAM_UPPERSTACK_SIZE        (3*1024)

Bluetooth features supported by the bt_host_0_0 are introduced in the bt_host_config.h
file in the bt_host_0_0 folder. The path of bt_host_config.h for bt_host_0_0 is
bin\rtl87x2g\bt_host_image\bt_host_0_0\bt_host_config.h.

/*============================================================================*
 *                          bt_host_3_0                                    *
 *============================================================================*/
The flash size of bt_host_3_0 image is 148K. If Application uses bt_host_3_0, 
Application should configure NS_RAM_UPPERSTACK_SIZE as value which is larger than or equal to (3 * 1024) in mem_config.h of Application.

/** @brief data ram size for Bluetooth Host global variables and code */
#define NS_RAM_UPPERSTACK_SIZE        (3*1024)

Bluetooth features supported by the bt_host_3_0 are introduced in the bt_host_config.h
file in the bt_host_3_0 folder. The path of bt_host_config.h for bt_host_3_0 is
bin\rtl87x2g\bt_host_image\bt_host_3_0\bt_host_config.h.